// template: Melodic techno
// order: 1
tempo 124
key a minor

kick:   kick       deep    x... x... x... x...                                   | gain 0.9
sub:    sub        warm    a1 . . . a1 . . . / f1 . . . f1 . . . / d1 . . . d1 . . . / e1 . . . e1 . . .   | duck 0.8
bass:   bass       rolling . a2 a2 a2 . a2 c3 a2 / . f2 f2 f2 . f2 a2 f2 / . d2 d2 d2 . d2 f2 d2 / . e2 e2 e2 . g2 e2 b2   | duck 0.7 | comp 0.3 | pan 0.1
hat:    hat        closed  . x x?0.6 x . x x?0.6 x . x x?0.6 x . x x?0.7 x     | gain 0.6 | swing 0.1 | pan -0.15
ohat:   hat        open    ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                   | gain 0.5 | pan 0.15
shaker: shaker     soft    x x?0.7 x x?0.8 x x?0.7 x x?0.8 x x?0.7 x x?0.8 x x?0.7 X x?0.8   | swing 0.16 | gain 0.35 | pan 0.3
conga:  conga      open    . . x . x . . x . . x . x . x?0.4 x?0.5               | swing 0.16 | pan -0.35 | reverb small
rim:    rim        click   .... ..x. .... .x.x                                   | pan 0.4 | delay 3/16 | gain 1
perc:   perc       ping    .... .... ..x. .x..                                   | pan -0.2 | delay 1/8 | reverb small
clap:   clap       roomy   .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb small | gain 1
pad:    pad        warm    Am9 ~ ~ ~ / Fmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Dm9 ~ ~ ~ / Em7 ~ ~ ~       | voicing spread | brightness sine(16) 0.3..0.7 | duck 0.5 | reverb sea | gain 0.6
pluck:  pluck      bright  Am9 ~ ~ ~ / Fmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Dm9 ~ ~ ~ / Em7 ~ ~ ~       | arp updown | arp-rate 1/16 | arp-octaves 2 | highpass 300 | delay 3/16 | gain 0.6
keys:   epiano     soft    . Am7 . . Am7 . . . / . Fmaj7 . . Fmaj7 . . . / . Dm7 . . Dm7 . . . / . Em7 . . Em7! . . .   | voicing open | chorus 0.25 | reverb wide | gain 0.5
lead:   lead       soft    e4 ~ ~ . c4 ~ d4 ~ / a3 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . . / c4 ~ ~ . d4 ~ e4 ~ / g4 ~ ~ ~ e4 ~ ~ .   | legato | glide 0.08 | delay 1/4 | reverb sea | gain 0.9
choir:  choir      ooh     Am ~ ~ ~ / F ~ ~ ~ / Dm ~ ~ ~ / Em ~ ~ ~              | vowel sine(8) 0.2..0.6 | eq-high 3 | reverb sea | gain 0.5
rise:   noise      white   x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..9000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:  riser      noise   x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 15.5 | gain 0.6
down:   downlifter noise   x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.8
impact: impact     deep    x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb sea | gain 0.9

section intro   kick hat shaker conga rim pad
section groove  kick sub bass hat ohat shaker conga rim perc clap pad keys | loop
section build   kick sub hat ohat shaker conga perc clap pad pluck rise
section break   pad pluck keys choir down
section lift    hat pad pluck choir riser
section drop    kick sub bass hat ohat shaker conga rim perc clap pad pluck lead choir impact
section groove2 kick sub bass hat ohat shaker conga rim perc clap keys pluck
section break2  pad keys choir lead down
section drop2   kick sub bass hat ohat shaker conga rim perc clap pad pluck keys lead choir impact
section outro   kick hat shaker conga rim pad

song intro 16, groove 32, build 8, break 16, lift 8, drop 32, groove2 16, break2 16, lift 8, drop2 32, outro 16
